# Drumsets for a Roland TD-20 synthesizer

# Names for the program change events that select different drumsets on
# a drum track.
.drumsets

0 1 Standard Drums
8 9 Room Set
16 17 Power Set
24 25 Electronic Set
25 26 TR-808 Set
32 33 Jazz Set
40 41 Brush Set
48 49 Orchestra Set
64 65 Studio Kit
